# This repository is the published instance, so it does NOT inherit the
# template's "instance data" block. Everything the template ignores as
# generated output (history.json, the feeds, index.html, archive.html,
# archive-*.html, sitemap.xml, robots.txt, 404.html, birds/, assets/,
# cache/, maps/) is exactly what this repository exists to publish, and
# the daily workflow stages it with "git add -A .". Adding those lines
# here would silently stop new pages from ever being committed.

# Agent scratch (worktrees and plan ledgers, never published)
.worktrees/
.superpowers/
